### Topic 69 - sample requests
### Local:       mvn spring-boot:run                                   -> port 8080
### Kubernetes:  kubectl port-forward service/menu-service 8080:80     -> port 8080

### Which pod answered? (run several times in Kubernetes - hostname changes)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/info

### The menu (values come from the ConfigMap in Kubernetes)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/menu

### Probes used by Kubernetes
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health/liveness

###
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health/readiness

### Build info (version, time)
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/info

### Take this instance out of the load balancer (readiness -> 503)
POST http://localhost:8080/ops/readiness/off

### Put it back
POST http://localhost:8080/ops/readiness/on

### Slow request - stop the app while it runs to see graceful shutdown
GET http://localhost:8080/api/slow?seconds=10
